th the pandemic, it's more important than ever to make sure...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112364043499511","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1304","post_id":"1304","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112354898880401","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-18","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1304/","text":"We've lost another hero. Thank you RBG for everything you've done for our country.","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112354898880401","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1305","post_id":"1305","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/videos/10112344994972911/","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1305/","text":null,"like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"unavailable","text_source":null,"text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1293","post_id":"1293","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112345197906231","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1293/","text":"Today we announced Oculus Quest 2. It's lighter, faster and has a better display than the first generation -- and it starts at just $299.\n\nIt's fully wireless and it has hands-down the best content...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112345197906231","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1292","post_id":"1292","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112346538444781","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-16","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1292/","text":"I've said before that I believe augmented and virtual reality will be the next major computing platforms. I sat down with MKBHD to discuss what that might mean -- a future where we can feel fully...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112346538444781","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1296","post_id":"1296","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112337066541551","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-15","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1296/","text":"Today we're launching the Climate Science Information Center -- a dedicated space that we'll be highlighting at the top of Facebook with authoritative information from the world's leading climate...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112337066541551","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1295","post_id":"1295","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112340462945131","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-15","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1295/","text":"Scoring one last goal against Andrew Bosworth (Boz) in Echo Arena before Facebook Connect tomorrow. I'm excited to share what we've been working on across augmented and virtual reality. Tune in here...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112340462945131","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1291","post_id":"1291","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112317677207931","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-11","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1291/","text":"We're less than two months away from the US elections, and we are seeing a massive shortage of poll workers to staff voting stations. Shortages can lead to hours-long waits at the polls, which makes...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112317677207931","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1286","post_id":"1286","platform":"facebook","author":"zuck","original_url":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112270823363411","published_at":null,"published_date":"2020-09-03","date_precision":"day","source_ids":["zuckerberg-files"],"source_url":"https://epublications.marquette.edu/zuckerberg_files_transcripts/1286/","text":"The US elections are just two months away, and with Covid-19 affecting communities across the country, I'm concerned about the challenges people could face when voting. I'm also worried that with our...","like_count":null,"likes_captured_at":null,"likes_source":null,"text_status":"captured_original_page_description","text_source":"https://www.facebook.com/zuck/posts/10112270823363411","text_truncated":false},{"id":"archive-1287","post_id":"1287","platform":"